<!--META {"out":"projects.html","title":"Get Geospatial Quotes — drone mapping, GIS, satellite imagery & surveys","desc":"Describe your project once and get matched with vetted drone mapping, GIS, satellite imagery, surveying and cartography specialists. Free, no obligation.","schema":{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","serviceType":"Geospatial services matching","provider":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Geo.Vision"},"areaServed":"Worldwide","description":"Free matching service connecting clients with drone mapping, GIS, satellite imagery and surveying professionals."}} -->
<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap band-grid">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Geo.Vision Projects · free matching service</p>
    <h1>Maps, drones &amp; imagery — without the guesswork</h1>
    <p class="lede">Tell us what you need in under three minutes. We review every brief by hand and introduce you to up to three specialists who fit your location, budget and deadline. You compare quotes and choose — or walk away. No fees, no obligation.</p>
    <p class="chips"><span class="chip">✓ Free for clients</span><span class="chip">✓ Reply within 1 business day</span><span class="chip">✓ Your details go to max. 3 firms</span><span class="chip">✓ Worldwide</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="card card-lead"><h3>Popular requests</h3><ul class="plain">
    <li>📐 Drone survey &amp; orthomosaic of a construction site</li><li>🌾 Crop-health (NDVI) mapping for a farm</li><li>🛰️ Recent high-resolution satellite image of a property</li><li>🗺️ Custom illustrated map for a book, resort or event</li><li>📊 Store-location &amp; catchment analysis for a retailer</li><li>🌊 Flood or wildfire risk map for insurance or planning</li></ul></div>
</div></section>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="card"><div class="icon">1</div><h3>Describe your project</h3><p>Service, location, size, budget and timing. The more detail, the better the match.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="icon">2</div><h3>We match you</h3><p>We check the brief and introduce you to specialists with relevant experience in your region.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="icon">3</div><h3>Compare &amp; choose</h3><p>Providers contact you with questions and quotes. You decide who to hire — directly with them.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" id="brief">
  <div class="form-card" style="max-width:860px;margin-inline:auto">
    <form data-form="lead-full" data-steps data-subject="Geo.Vision PROJECT LEAD" data-ok="Brief received — thank you! A project specialist will review it and contact you within one business day.">
      <div class="game-top"><h2 style="margin:0">Project brief</h2><span class="muted small step-count"></span></div>
      <div class="steps-bar"><i></i></div>

      <fieldset class="step"><legend>What do you need?</legend>
        <div class="opt-grid">
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Drone mapping / aerial survey" required><span>Drone mapping<small>Orthomosaics, 3D models, volumes, inspections</small></span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="service" value="GIS analysis & consulting"><span>GIS analysis<small>Spatial analysis, data cleanup, dashboards</small></span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Satellite imagery"><span>Satellite imagery<small>Archive or new tasking, change detection</small></span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Custom map design"><span>Custom map design<small>Print, web, illustrated, wayfinding</small></span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Land / property survey"><span>Land survey<small>Boundaries, topographic, LiDAR</small></span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Location intelligence for business"><span>Location intelligence<small>Site selection, catchments, geomarketing</small></span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Environmental / risk mapping"><span>Risk &amp; environment<small>Flood, fire, carbon, biodiversity</small></span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Training / education"><span>GIS training<small>Teams, classrooms, workshops</small></span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="service" value="Other geospatial need"><span>Something else<small>Tell us in the next step</small></span></label>
        </div>
        <div class="field"><label for="industry">Your sector</label><select id="industry" name="industry" required><option value="">Choose…</option><option>Construction &amp; engineering</option><option>Real estate &amp; property</option><option>Agriculture &amp; forestry</option><option>Energy &amp; utilities</option><option>Mining &amp; quarrying</option><option>Insurance &amp; finance</option><option>Government &amp; public sector</option><option>NGO &amp; research</option><option>Retail &amp; logistics</option><option>Tourism &amp; hospitality</option><option>Media &amp; publishing</option><option>Education</option><option>Personal / private</option><option>Other</option></select></div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="step"><legend>About the project</legend>
        <div class="row2"><div class="field"><label for="region">Location</label><input id="region" name="region" placeholder="City, region, country or coordinates" required></div><div class="field"><label for="size">Approximate size</label><select id="size" name="size" required><option value="">Choose…</option><option>Single building / under 1 ha</option><option>1–10 ha (up to ~25 acres)</option><option>10–100 ha</option><option>100–1,000 ha</option><option>Over 1,000 ha / regional</option><option>Country or global</option><option>Not location-bound</option></select></div></div>
        <fieldset class="field" style="border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 1rem"><legend class="small" style="font:600 .92rem var(--f-body);margin-bottom:.4rem">Deliverables you expect (optional)</legend><div class="opt-grid">
          <label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="deliverables" value="Maps / PDFs"><span>Maps / PDFs</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="deliverables" value="GIS data (SHP, GeoJSON, GeoTIFF)"><span>GIS data files</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="deliverables" value="3D model / point cloud"><span>3D / point cloud</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="deliverables" value="Report / analysis"><span>Report</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="deliverables" value="Web map / dashboard"><span>Web map</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="checkbox" name="deliverables" value="Photos / video"><span>Photos / video</span></label>
        </div></fieldset>
        <div class="field"><label for="details">Describe the project</label><textarea id="details" name="details" required minlength="20" placeholder="What is the goal? What decisions will the result support? Any existing data, standards or constraints?"></textarea></div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="step"><legend>Budget &amp; timing</legend>
        <label>Budget range (USD)</label>
        <div class="opt-grid">
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="Under $1,000" required><span>Under $1k</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="$1,000–5,000"><span>$1k–5k</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="$5,000–25,000"><span>$5k–25k</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="$25,000–100,000"><span>$25k–100k</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="Over $100,000"><span>$100k+</span></label>
          <label class="opt"><input type="radio" name="budget" value="Not sure yet"><span>Not sure yet</span></label>
        </div>
        <div class="row2"><div class="field"><label for="timeline">When do you need it?</label><select id="timeline" name="timeline" required><option value="">Choose…</option><option>Urgent — within 2 weeks</option><option>Within 1 month</option><option>1–3 months</option><option>3+ months</option><option>Flexible / researching</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="stage">Where are you in the decision?</label><select id="stage" name="stage" required><option value="">Choose…</option><option>Ready to hire</option><option>Comparing quotes</option><option>Budgeting / planning</option><option>Just exploring</option></select></div></div>
      </fieldset>

      <fieldset class="step"><legend>Where should specialists reach you?</legend>
        <div class="row2"><div class="field"><label for="p-name">Full name</label><input id="p-name" name="name" required autocomplete="name"></div><div class="field"><label for="p-email">Email</label><input id="p-email" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email"></div></div>
        <div class="row2"><div class="field"><label for="p-phone">Phone (optional)</label><input id="p-phone" type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel"></div><div class="field"><label for="p-company">Organisation (optional)</label><input id="p-company" name="company" autocomplete="organization"></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="p-contact">Preferred contact</label><select id="p-contact" name="contact_pref"><option>Email</option><option>Phone</option><option>Video call</option></select></div>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required> I agree that Geo.Vision may share this brief with up to three relevant providers so they can contact me, as described in the <a href="privacy.html">privacy policy</a>.</label>
        <input type="text" name="_honey" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
      </fieldset>

      <div class="step-nav"><button class="btn btn-ghost" type="button" data-prev>&larr; Back</button><button class="btn btn-accent" type="button" data-next>Continue &rarr;</button><button class="btn btn-accent" type="submit">Send my brief</button></div>
      <p class="form-msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Services</p><h2>What our specialists deliver</h2></div></div>
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="card"><h3>Drone mapping &amp; inspection</h3><p>Centimetre-scale orthophotos, elevation models, stockpile volumes, roof and solar inspections, progress monitoring. Typical lead time 1–3 weeks, weather permitting.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>GIS analysis &amp; data</h3><p>Data cleanup and conversion, spatial joins, suitability and proximity analysis, routing, automated pipelines and interactive dashboards.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Satellite imagery</h3><p>Archive search across commercial and open providers, new tasking, before/after change detection, NDVI and land-cover classification.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Surveying &amp; LiDAR</h3><p>Topographic and boundary surveys by licensed surveyors, terrestrial and airborne LiDAR, as-built documentation.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Cartography &amp; design</h3><p>Print-ready wall maps, illustrated destination maps, wayfinding, publication figures and branded web maps.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Location intelligence</h3><p>Site selection, catchment and footfall analysis, territory design, competitor mapping and demographic overlays.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="providers">
  <div class="wrap band-grid">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">For providers</p><h2>Are you a drone pilot, GIS consultant or mapping studio?</h2><p class="lede">Join the Geo.Vision provider network to receive qualified, hand-checked project briefs in your region and specialities. Listing is free during our launch period.</p><ul class="plain"><li>✓ Briefs filtered by service, region and budget</li><li>✓ Never shared with more than three providers</li><li>✓ Optional featured profile on our atlas pages</li></ul></div>
    <div class="form-card">
      <form data-form="provider" data-subject="Geo.Vision PROVIDER signup" data-ok="Thanks for applying! We'll review your profile and reply within 3 business days.">
        <div class="row2"><div class="field"><label for="pv-co">Company / name</label><input id="pv-co" name="company" required></div><div class="field"><label for="pv-web">Website or portfolio</label><input id="pv-web" type="url" name="website" placeholder="https://" required></div></div>
        <div class="row2"><div class="field"><label for="pv-name">Contact name</label><input id="pv-name" name="name" required></div><div class="field"><label for="pv-email">Email</label><input id="pv-email" type="email" name="email" required></div></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="pv-svc">Services offered</label><input id="pv-svc" name="services" placeholder="e.g. drone mapping, LiDAR, GIS analysis" required></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="pv-reg">Regions you cover</label><input id="pv-reg" name="regions" placeholder="e.g. Ontario & Quebec, remote worldwide" required></div>
        <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="licensed" value="yes"> We hold the licences/insurance required in our regions (e.g. drone pilot certification, professional surveyor).</label>
        <input type="text" name="_honey" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
        <button class="btn btn-accent btn-block" type="submit">Apply to join</button>
        <p class="form-msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap prose">
  <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
  <details><summary>Is it really free?</summary><p>Yes. Clients never pay Geo.Vision. Providers may pay a referral or listing fee, which never changes the price you are quoted.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Who will see my details?</summary><p>Our team, and at most three providers we judge to be a good fit. We don't sell lists or add you to marketing campaigns. See the <a href="privacy.html">privacy policy</a>.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How much does drone mapping cost?</summary><p>It depends on area, accuracy and deliverables. Small single-site jobs are often in the low thousands of US dollars, while large or survey-grade projects with ground control cost more. Our <a href="guides/hiring-a-drone-mapping-service.html">guide to hiring a drone mapping service</a> explains the cost drivers.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Do you vet providers?</summary><p>We review each provider's portfolio, website and stated licensing before introducing them, and remove providers who receive repeated complaints. You remain responsible for checking credentials, insurance and contract terms before hiring.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What if I only need advice?</summary><p>Choose "Something else" and describe your question. Many specialists offer short paid consultations, and our <a href="guides/index.html">guides</a> may answer it for free.</p></details>
</section>
